Visualize hosts that have sent a large amount of data outbound in a few amount of questions.
index=box sourcetype="zeek:conn:json" | stats sum(bytes_out) as bytes_out count by src_ip dest_ip | where bytes_out > 100000000 AND count < 10 | sort - bytes_out


Visualize all indexes available in your instance of Splunk, set your time for 1hr as the longer the time the more risk to the system.
index=* | stats count by index
